{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["\n",{"->":"start"},["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":["ev",{"VAR?":"NPC.kase"},{"f()":"register_npc"},"pop","/ev","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"npcs_talked"},2,">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"hub_b"},{"->":"start.13"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"hub_a"},{"->":"start.13"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"#f":1}],"hub_a":[["^Kase: Don’t waste my time.","\n","^Kase: I’m working.","\n","ev","str","^Sorry.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},"ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":4},{"c-0":["^ ","end","\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","end","\n",{"#f":5}],"c-2":["^ ","end","\n",{"#f":5}],"c-3":["^ ","end","\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"hub_b":["^Kase sits apart from the main path, surrounded by scraps of notes and charcoal sketches of old mechanisms.","\n","^He doesn’t greet you—he just pauses mid-writing, waiting to see if you’re worth the interruption.","\n","^Kase: Speak.","\n","^Kase: And if you want comfort, go talk to someone who sells it.","\n",{"->":"b_menu"},{"#f":1}],"b_menu":[["ev","str","^Leave.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Who are you?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^What caused the collapse?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},"ev","str","^What do you fear the scholars will do?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":4},{"c-0":["^ ","end","\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"b1"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-2":["^ ",{"->":"b2"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-3":["^ ",{"->":"b3"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"b1":["^Kase: Kase. Researcher.","\n","^I write down the parts everyone avoids: cause and consequence.","\n","^<b>Solace</b> survives because we learn. Not because we hope.","\n","^Hope is for people with safety.","\n","^Kase: Most people want stories.","\n","^Kase: I want mechanisms.","\n",{"->":"b_menu"},{"#f":1}],"b2":["^Kase: One buried <b>system</b> fed the whole “advanced” age.","\n","^Power, distribution, regulation—everything ran through it.","\n","^Then it <b>failed</b>, and the world’s tech died together.","\n","^Not “slowly.” Not “over time.” Together.","\n","^Like a body when the heart stops.","\n","^Kase: If you want meaning, you’ll find it later.","\n","^Kase: First you need the shape of the truth.","\n",{"->":"b_menu"},{"#f":1}],"b3":["^Kase: If they find the <b>old system</b>, they’ll try to restart it.","\n","^They’ll tell themselves it’ll be different this time.","\n","^It never is.","\n","^The planet paid once already.","\n","^I won’t help anyone make it pay twice.","\n","^Kase: Scholars talk about “saving” Aurelia.","\n","^Kase: Sometimes saving looks a lot like taking.","\n",{"->":"b_menu"},{"#f":1}],"register_npc":[{"temp=":"who"},["ev",{"VAR?":"met_npcs"},{"VAR?":"who"},"?","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",false,"/ev","~ret",{"->":".^.^.^.3"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"met_npcs"},{"VAR?":"who"},"+",{"VAR=":"met_npcs","re":true},"/ev","ev",{"VAR?":"npcs_talked"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"npcs_talked","re":true},"/ev","ev",true,"/ev","~ret",{"->":".^.^.^.3"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"#f":1}],"global decl":["ev",{"list":{},"origins":["NPC"]},{"VAR=":"NPC"},{"list":{}},{"VAR=":"met_npcs"},0,{"VAR=":"npcs_talked"},0,{"VAR=":"Dialogue_scrap"},false,{"VAR=":"met_child"},false,{"VAR=":"maerlon_gave_scrap"},false,{"VAR=":"drayk_gave_scrap"},false,{"VAR=":"spoke_to_marrek"},0,{"VAR=":"danriel_block_level"},false,{"VAR=":"stolen_scrap"},"/ev","end",null],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{"NPC":{"maerlon":1,"child":2,"marrek":3,"eira":4,"drayk":5,"kase":6,"erixa":7,"sanya":8,"julisa":9,"harvel":10,"camla":11,"nayli":12,"danriel":13,"emex":14,"tamira":15,"emerys":16,"grald":17}}}